From daeb0f8e8020f0472adcb78681eac5c353115b0d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Rishabh Kothari <rishkoth@qti.qualcomm.com>
Date: Mon, 5 Jan 2026 08:07:02 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] mplane-changes

FR108021 - QNCM Discovery API Redesign

FR110645 QRU Continuous Logging

Doesn't use sock_pending when select() timed out

Add setlevel and log callback for libssh on call-home thread

Add sleep of 500ms before starting call home thread

Allow all versions when reading server capabilities. O-RAN
 modules use YANG version 1.1 instead of 1.0, they would be left out with the
 old LYS_VERSION_1.

Allow the mplane generated message ids in addition to internally
generated message id.

fix send complete rpc reply msg to NetConf client and MplaneApp

re-call-home-no-ssh-time feature support

Forward error message without adding any xml tags when the error is not
coming from sysrepo

Adding default value of re_call_home_no_ssh_timer

Invaldate mplane message ID after use

libnetconf2 support for local binding

Return only yang version 1.0 modules in <hello> message.

Fix memory leak that happens when client is terminated

Implment support for max call home attempts

Add callback notification when max call home attemps
have been made

support for mplane dscp change

Callback notification when max call home attemps have been made is done
only if no clients are not available for re-call-home procedure.

Print all packets sent and received

Fix ru controller availability counter

Signed-off-by: Romain Chaumontet <quic_rchaumon@quicinc.com>

Signed-off-by: Rishi Singh <quic_rishikan@quicinc.com>
